{"ref":"BDB, מִפְתָּח","hw":"מִפְתָּח","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְתָּח</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>opening, utterance</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְתַּח שְׂפָתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.6\">Pr 8:6</a> i.e. that with which my lips open.","next":"BDB, מַפְתֵּחַ²","prev":"BDB, יִפְתַּח־אֵל"}